{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01NN36YJrdf7qboXJsSnhfPb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Anchor R&D Control Surface â€” Master Plan (frozen design): grounded summary\n\n**North Star (locked)**\n- Transform Anchor from a task/project tracker into a **per-project R&D control surface**, where each code project is a folder (e.g., `C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home`, `C:\\dev\\Anchor`).\n- A single-instance dashboard window drives the **researchPrime â†’ Crucible â†’ Foreman** trio as durable, server-owned Claude Code jobs running on **gwl-server**.\n- Scope of the surface includes: versioned effort history, taskâ†”project integration, project lifecycle states, deliverable execution, and a **data-free public distribution**.\n\n**Locked design decisions (D-series)**\n- **D1 â€” One uniform job primitive.** A job is `claude -p --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json` running the relevant **skill** (researchPrime / crucible / foreman) in the project cwd, **owned by the Anchor server**. A \"lane\" = which skill + prompt template. No per-lane orchestration code, no PTY, stdlib only.\n- **D2 â€” Gate handling is in-session.** A skill's `AskUserQuestion` gate **surfaces in the stream** (it auto-dismisses headless, but the structured question stays visible); Anchor renders it in a prompt box and **sends the user's choice back as a plain-text turn** to continue the session.\n\n**Locked user decisions (Decision Log, Crucible 2026-06-07/08)**\n- **Brownfield extend** of Anchor (`C:\\dev\\Anchor`); objective = new capability.\n- **Session model = streaming console, stdlib-only** â€” not a full TUI; no PTY, no dependencies.\n- **Registry = a new parallel R&D registry**, distinct from life-domain projects.\n- **Artifacts live inside each project's `.anchor/`** as pointer-records; engine outputs stay in their native form.\n- **v1 scope = all three trio lanes, Claude Code CLI only** (Gemini deferred).\n- **Auth = run the Anchor service as `john`**, resolving the LocalSystem credential wall.\n- **Remote access = bind the Tailscale interface + a shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*` endpoints.\n\n**Provenance**\n- Member documents: Master Plan (frozen design), Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, and Decision Log.\n- Decisions are recorded as Crucible outputs with the adversarial findings that drove them.\n\n---\n*Note: this summary is grounded strictly in the anchors provided from the member documents; I did not read the underlying docs in the repo for this turn. If you want, I can open `planning/rnd-v2/` (or the original `planning/` design docs) to verify or expand any specific claim.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20111,"cache_read_input_tokens":20573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20111},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"63845b17-147e-4687-8c62-0871ed36baa2","uuid":"29dea10b-c100-43b9-b560-485a8385a697","request_id":"req_011CbyGtAWNMN3BRx3fZSSic"}
